# Line-ending policy for the librechat_ynh repository.
#
# This repo has no .gitattributes and the dev box has core.autocrlf=true.
# Without pinning, a Windows checkout can convert scripts/* to CRLF, which:
#   - breaks `#!/bin/bash` (bad interpreter / \r errors),
#   - trips shellcheck SC1017,
#   - confuses the linter's shlex/grep parsing.
# Do NOT rely on core.autocrlf alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
scripts/* text eol=lf
manifest.toml text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
